# Solana RPC endpoint used for all on-chain reads (mint account, on-chain
# metadata, holder concentration). Defaults to the public Solana mainnet
# endpoint below if unset, so the app works out of the box with zero setup.
#
# The public endpoint aggressively rate-limits getTokenLargestAccounts, so
# the "Largest Holder Concentration" / "Top 10 Holder Concentration" signals
# will usually show as "Unavailable" on the default endpoint. For reliable
# holder data, sign up for a free-tier RPC provider (no cost, ~2 minutes)
# and paste its URL here:
#   - Helius:   https://helius.dev            (free tier, generous limits)
#   - QuickNode: https://quicknode.com        (free tier)
#   - Alchemy:  https://alchemy.com           (free tier)
#
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
